  The dashboard shell.

  The body renders server-side on first paint rather than being pulled in with
  hx-trigger="load". The range selector has to come back from the server with
  the right button marked active, so it lives inside the swapped region — and
  lazy-loading a region that contains the control you just clicked means the
  selector disappears and reappears on every change.
#}
